The data content in ChEMBL is licensed under a highly permissive Creative
Commons license - specifically the "CC Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported
license", see LICENSE file. The required attribution should contain the url
of the ChEMBL resource, and also the release version, e.g.:

ChEMBL data is from http://www.ebi.ac.uk/chembl - the version of ChEMBL is
chembl_37.

This should be visible on the entry portal for a web resource in which
ChEMBL is integrated, or contained with the documentation for any further
distribution.


Contents of this directory:
---------------------------

README                               This file

LICENSE                              License data is released under: Creative
                                     Commons Attribution-Share Alike 3.0
                                     Unported License

chembl_37_release_notes.txt          chembl_37 release details, which includes
                                     counts and schema change information

chembl_37_schema_documentation.html  Listing of all chembl_37 tables and
                                     columns in html format

chembl_37_schema_documentation.txt   Listing of all chembl_37 tables and
                                     columns in plain text format

chembl_37.fa.gz                      Fasta file of proteins in chembl_37
                                     target_dictionary table

chembl_37_bio.fa.gz                  Fasta file of the sequences of proteins
                                     in the chembl_37 biotherapeutics table

chembl_37.sdf.gz                     SDF of chembl_37 compounds, includes
                                     chembl_id

chembl_37_chemreps.txt.gz            Tab-separated file containing different
                                     chemical representations (SMILES, InChI
                                     and InChI Key) of chembl_37 compounds,
                                     includes chembl_id

chembl_37_monomer_library.xml        chembl_37 HELM monomer library

chembl_37_schema.png                 Schema diagram of chembl_37 database

chembl_37_mysql.tar.gz               Files required to load chembl_37 data
                                     into a MySQL database (5.7.27)

chembl_37_postgresql.tar.gz          Files required to load chembl_37 data
                                     into a PostgreSQL database (10.15)

chembl_37_sqlite.tar.gz              Files required to load chembl_37 data
                                     into a SQLite database (3.26.0)

chembl_uniprot_mapping.txt           Mapping between chembl_37 target
                                     chembl_ids and UniProt accessions

chembl_37.fps.gz                     2048 bit radius 2 morgan FPS format
                                     fingerprints of chembl_37 compounds,
                                     includes chembl_id as id

chembl_37.h5                         2048 bit radius 2 morgan FPSim2 fingerprint 
                                     database file of chembl_37 compounds,
                                     includes molregno as id

chembl_37_blast.fa.gz                Fasta file used to index EBI's  blast service

chembl_37_hmmr.fa.gz                 Fasta file used to index EBI's HMMR service


checksums.txt                        SHA-256 checksum hashes for ftp files
